        "Node name for S&R": "MarkdownNote"
      },
      "widgets_values": [
        "## Drag the face\n\nLoad the generated character in CHARACTER. Press the button on FACE RIG and drag the handles. The eye gizmo is the gaze. The ball in the corner is the head turn. This pose starts with the eyes looking left and the head yawed 10 degrees toward screen-left.\n\nStitching is on, so the posed face is blended back onto the shoulders. If the head is small in the frame, lower crop factor toward 1.5. Past about 12 degrees the warp starts to chew the edges.\n\nThe first run downloads LivePortrait into models/liveportrait. If FACE RIG is missing, the NKD pack is not installed."
      ],
      "widgets_values_named": {
        "text": "## Drag the face\n\nLoad the generated character in CHARACTER. Press the button on FACE RIG and drag the handles. The eye gizmo is the gaze. The ball in the corner is the head turn. This pose starts with the eyes looking left and the head yawed 10 degrees toward screen-left.\n\nStitching is on, so the posed face is blended back onto the shoulders. If the head is small in the frame, lower crop factor toward 1.5. Past about 12 degrees the warp starts to chew the edges.\n\nThe first run downloads LivePortrait into models/liveportrait. If FACE RIG is missing, the NKD pack is not installed."
      }
    },
